{"additions":2,"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## v0.16.1\n\n- #192 — every list scrolls the same way up as down: the scroll offset is kept across frames instead of being recomputed each frame, so moving up from the bottom walks the page before scrolling one row at the edge (GitHub lists, Git file tree / branches / reflog / log, Files, Docker, Worktrees, Projects list, run Jobs, Procs, PR Checks)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w\n","changedFiles":2,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-11T04:54:38Z","deletions":2,"headRefName":"release/0.16.1","labels":[],"number":193,"reviewDecision":"","reviewRequests":[],"reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABNHWpfw","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe release metadata changes are synchronized and have no unresolved review comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nPrepares the v0.16.1 release by updating synchronized Cargo metadata.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Bumps the package version to `0.16.1`.\n- Synchronizes the lockfile version.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Summary |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| `Cargo.toml` | Sets the package version to `0.16.1`. |\r\n| `Cargo.lock` | Updates the locked package version. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 1/2 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 0\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review